# bug-03-attr-bool-off.direct -- marker file only; jig.c dispatches
# on the "bug-03-" basename prefix to run_direct_bug03_attr_bool().
#
# Demonstrates isocline-issues.rst #3 (moderate): attr_update_bool()
# in src/bbcode.c has "if (strcmp(value,"on") || strcmp(value,"true")
# || strcmp(value,"1"))", which is always true (a string can't equal
# all three at once, so at most one strcmp() is 0 and the other two
# are always nonzero/true) -- so bbcode markup like "[bold=off]"
# always turns the attribute ON instead of off.
